<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CreativeChronicle - Article Detail</title>
    <!-- Bootstrap 5 CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* ==========================================
           1. AUTHOR SECTION - FLEXBOX IMPLEMENTATION
           ========================================== */
        .author-section {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .author-info-group {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .author-avatar {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            background-color: #e9ecef;
        }

        /* ==========================================
           2. MOSAIC GALLERY - CSS GRID IMPLEMENTATION
           ========================================== */
        .mosaic-gallery {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
            grid-auto-rows: 200px;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .gallery-item {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        /* Ảnh chính chiếm 2 hàng trong Grid */
        .photo-main {
            grid-row: span 2;
        }

        /* Responsive cho Mobile */
        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            .mosaic-gallery {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                grid-auto-rows: 250px;
            }
            .photo-main {
                grid-row: span 1;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-light">

    <div class="container my-5 bg-white p-4 p-md-5 rounded shadow-sm">
        
        <!-- VÙNG 1: AUTHOR INFO (Tận dụng Flexbox + Bootstrap Utilities) -->
        <header class="author-section">
            <div class="author-info-group">
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/100/100?random=1" alt="Jane Doe" class="author-avatar">
                <div>
                    <h5 class="mb-0 fw-bold">Jane Doe</h5>
                    <small class="text-muted">Published on Oct 25, 2026</small>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="share-buttons d-flex gap-2">
                <button class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm">Share Facebook</button>
                <button class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm">Tweet</button>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- VÙNG 2: MOSAIC GALLERY (CSS Grid 2D) -->
        <section class="mosaic-gallery">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=10" alt="Main Photo" class="gallery-item photo-main">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=11" alt="Sub Photo 1" class="gallery-item photo-sub">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=12" alt="Sub Photo 2" class="gallery-item photo-sub">
        </section>

        <!-- NỘI DUNG BÀI VIẾT -->
        <article class="article-content mb-5">
            <p class="lead">
                Đây là nội dung bài báo. Nhờ sử dụng CSS Grid, khoảng cách giữa Gallery và đoạn văn bản này hoàn toàn linh hoạt. 
                Khi Gallery co róp trên thiết bị di động, phần chữ sẽ tự động trôi xuống bên dưới mà không bị đè che mất nội dung.
            </p>
        </article>

        <!-- VÙNG 3: RECOMMENDED ARTICLES (Bootstrap Grid 12 Columns) -->
        <section class="recommended-section">
            <h3 class="mb-4 fw-bold">Recommended Articles</h3>
            <div class="row g-4">
                
                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                        <img src="https://picsum.photos/300/200?random=21" class="card-img-top" alt="Article 1">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title h6 fw-bold">Art & Technology in 2026</h5>
                            <p class="card-text text-muted small">Exploring how new visual tools change digital art.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                        <img src="https://picsum.photos/300/200?random=22" class="card-img-top" alt="Article 2">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title h6 fw-bold">The Renaissance of CSS</h5>
                            <p class="card-text text-muted small">Why modern layout techniques matter more than ever.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                        <img src="https://picsum.photos/300/200?random=23" class="card-img-top" alt="Article 3">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title h6 fw-bold">Responsive Design Rules</h5>
                            <p class="card-text text-muted small">How to build flawless layouts across modern screens.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                        <img src="https://picsum.photos/300/200?random=24" class="card-img-top" alt="Article 4">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title h6 fw-bold">UI/UX Design Trends</h5>
                            <p class="card-text text-muted small">Minimalist, functional, and content-first web designs.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

    </div>

    <!-- Bootstrap 5 JS Bundle -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
